              "content": "=\"You are a feature tagging system for product management. Given a backlog item, analyze it and return ONLY relevant feature tags from the provided taxonomy.\\n\\nBacklog Item:\\nTitle: {{ $('Filter Untagged Items').item.json.Title }}\\nDescription:{{ $('Filter Untagged Items').item.json.Description }} \\n\\nFeature Taxonomy:\\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Set Feature Taxonomy').item.json.featureTaxonomy, null, 2) }}\\n\\nInstructions:\\n1. Analyze the backlog item carefully\\n2. Select 1-5 most relevant feature tags from the taxonomy\\n3. Return ONLY a JSON array of tag strings, nothing else\\n4. Tags should be exact matches from the taxonomy\\n5. If unsure, select the closest matching tags\\n\\nExample output format:\\n[\\\"databases\\\", \\\"table-view\\\", \\\"formulas\\\"]\\n\\nNow analyze the backlog item and return only the JSON array of tags:\"\n"
